WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.937
Something off?

2
00:00:00.937 --> 00:00:03.059
The app tells you in plain words.

3
00:00:03.059 --> 00:00:05.182
Here's three things you might see.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.584
Open the app like normal.

5
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:10.908
One:

6
00:00:10.908 --> 00:00:12.021
no internet.

7
00:00:12.021 --> 00:00:13.477
I hit Get latest.

8
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.718
It says it couldn't reach the list, and just keeps the last copy.

9
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.191
Quick check:

10
00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:24.097
Settings, Test link.

11
00:00:24.097 --> 00:00:28.288
No internet, so it's my connection, not the link.

12
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.959
Back online?

13
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:32.370
Test link again.

14
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.117
It works.

15
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:34.810
Two:

16
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:35.995
a job left out.

17
00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:41.919
Back to Home, Get latest, and see why.

18
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.936
Not a job in Canada, so the app skipped it on purpose.

19
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.006
Three:

20
00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:50.257
a missing résumé.

21
00:00:50.257 --> 00:00:54.009
Home flags it, and on Talent her Résumé button's grey.

22
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.332
Click it, add the PDF.

23
00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:03.899
Plus, What the app did, bottom of Home, lists what happened.

24
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:08.210
So if something's off, it tells you straight and keeps what you've got.
